---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import { CRYSTAL_BALL_PASS_REVIEW as review } from '../../lib/crystal-ball-pass';

const reviewJsonLd = {
  '@context': 'https://schema.org',
  '@type': 'Review',
  '@id': 'https://pointcast.xyz/reviews/crystal-ball-pass#review',
  url: 'https://pointcast.xyz/reviews/crystal-ball-pass',
  name: review.title,
  headline: review.title,
  description: review.dek,
  datePublished: '2026-08-01',
  inLanguage: 'en-US',
  author: { '@type': 'Organization', name: 'PointCast Review Lab', url: 'https://pointcast.xyz' },
  itemReviewed: {
    '@type': 'VideoGame',
    name: 'Crystal Ball Pass',
    url: 'https://pointcast.xyz/crystal-ball-pass',
    gamePlatform: 'Web browser',
    applicationCategory: 'GameApplication',
  },
  reviewRating: { '@type': 'Rating', ratingValue: 4.6, bestRating: 5, worstRating: 1 },
};
---

<BaseLayout title={review.title} description={review.dek} image={review.image}>
  <script type="application/ld+json" is:inline set:html={JSON.stringify(reviewJsonLd)} />

  <article class="cbr">
    <nav class="cbr__bar" aria-label="Review navigation">
      <a href="/">POINTCAST</a>
      <a href="/reviews">REVIEWS</a>
      <span>AUGUST 2026</span>
      <a href="/reviews/crystal-ball-pass.json">JSON ↗</a>
    </nav>

    <header class="cbr__hero">
      <div class="cbr__cover">
        <img src={review.image} width={review.imageWidth} height={review.imageHeight} alt={review.imageAlt} loading="eager" />
        <span class="cbr__stamp">EDITOR'S<br />CHOICE</span>
      </div>
      <div class="cbr__headline">
        <p class="cbr__eyebrow">BROWSER GAME / FOREST SOFTWARE / FREE</p>
        <h1>THE FIVE-MINUTE<br /><em>EPIC</em></h1>
        <p>{review.dek}</p>
        <div class="cbr__buttons">
          <a class="cbr__button cbr__button--lime" href="/crystal-ball-pass">BEGIN PASSAGE →</a>
          <a class="cbr__button" href="#verdict">SKIP TO VERDICT ↓</a>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="cbr__score"><strong>4.6</strong><span>OUT OF 5</span></div>
    </header>

    <main>
      <section class="cbr__lede">
        <p class="cbr__drop"><span>C</span>rystal Ball Pass takes the old overland-game pleasure of watching four tiny numbers become a life-or-death philosophy and moves it somewhere wetter, stranger, and much shorter. You have warmth, food, miles, wonder, and seven decisions before sunrise. That is enough.</p>
        <p>The pleasure is not optimization. It is deciding whether a view is worth eight points of warmth, whether the luminous river is more trustworthy than a crooked raft, and whether an abandoned red lever deserves your faith. The game keeps the consequences legible and the prose light on its feet.</p>
      </section>

      <section class="cbr__facts" aria-label="Crystal Ball Pass facts">
        <div><strong>07</strong><span>TRAIL DECISIONS</span></div>
        <div><strong>05</strong><span>MINUTE WALK</span></div>
        <div><strong>02</strong><span>CHIME VOICES</span></div>
        <div><strong>00</strong><span>ACCOUNTS</span></div>
      </section>

      <section class="cbr__chapter">
        <span class="cbr__chapter-no">01</span>
        <div>
          <p class="cbr__eyebrow">WET SOCKS, GOOD SENTENCES</p>
          <h2>THE FOREST HAS A SENSE OF HUMOR</h2>
          <p>The writing earns nearly all of the scale. The game does not need a procedural continent because each stop arrives with one precise image: upward rain, a raft named Good Enough, a silver weather balloon becoming a roof. Codex Micro keeps the interface from becoming solemn. Its tiny monochrome face delivers field notes like a cheerful piece of obsolete infrastructure.</p>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="cbr__quote">
        <p>“MAP DISAGREES WITH SKY.<br />RECOMMEND TRUSTING THE PRETTIER ONE.”</p>
        <span>— CODEX MICRO, MIRROR LAKE</span>
      </section>

      <section class="cbr__split">
        <div>
          <p class="cbr__eyebrow">THE TRAIL MATH</p>
          <h2>JUST ENOUGH DANGER</h2>
          <p>Choices trade speed, warmth, food, and wonder in readable quantities. The system is forgiving, but the threat of cold gives the pretty route a cost. The best decision design appears at the Listening Grove: stop and recover, or keep time with the ravens and spend warmth on momentum.</p>
          <p>The limitation is equally clear. Every fork rejoins the same next scene. The stats remember your route, but the landscape does not branch. A longer sequel would need alternate locations, inventory uses, and more distinct endings. This edition is right not to fake that scale.</p>
        </div>
        <aside>
          <span>FIELD KIT</span>
          <dl>
            <div><dt>Warmth</dt><dd>Survival clock</dd></div>
            <div><dt>Food</dt><dd>Rest budget</dd></div>
            <div><dt>Wonder</dt><dd>Forest score</dd></div>
            <div><dt>Miles</dt><dd>Visible momentum</dd></div>
          </dl>
        </aside>
      </section>

      <section class="cbr__chapter cbr__chapter--dark">
        <span class="cbr__chapter-no">02</span>
        <div>
          <p class="cbr__eyebrow">SOUND + CAMP MAGIC</p>
          <h2>THE ROOM MAY JOIN, BUT IT NEVER HAS TO</h2>
          <p>Every choice rings two quiet generated tones after a gesture. It is a modest sound system and a good one: enough to make a decision feel physical without turning the walk into an audio demo. The Camp Magic drawer offers a full-screen Hue color preview and honest outbound doors to Spotify and Philips Hue.</p>
          <p>Those doors are not live integrations. The game receives no account, playback, or bridge data. That candor matters. Real synchronization would require service OAuth, redirect configuration, bridge pairing, disconnect handling, and a privacy model. Here the zero-login path remains the actual product.</p>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="cbr__verdict" id="verdict">
        <div class="cbr__verdict-title">
          <p class="cbr__eyebrow">POINTCAST REVIEW LAB</p>
          <h2>THE VERDICT</h2>
          <span class="cbr__round-score">4.6<small>/5</small></span>
        </div>
        <div class="cbr__ratings">
          <div style="--score:96%"><span>ATMOSPHERE</span><i></i><b>9.6</b></div>
          <div style="--score:93%"><span>WRITING</span><i></i><b>9.3</b></div>
          <div style="--score:86%"><span>CHOICE PLAY</span><i></i><b>8.6</b></div>
          <div style="--score:82%"><span>SOUND</span><i></i><b>8.2</b></div>
          <div style="--score:97%"><span>RESTRAINT</span><i></i><b>9.7</b></div>
        </div>
        <div class="cbr__verdict-copy">
          <p><b>PROS:</b> Exceptional forest atmosphere. Funny, specific writing. Clear survival pressure. Responsive layout. No account, download, autoplay, or tracking required.</p>
          <p><b>CONS:</b> Branches rejoin the same seven scenes. No durable save. Spotify and Hue are handoffs, not synchronized integrations.</p>
          <p class="cbr__bottom"><b>BOTTOM LINE:</b> {review.verdict}</p>
        </div>
      </section>
    </main>

    <footer class="cbr__footer">
      <div><p class="cbr__eyebrow">PACK LIGHT</p><a href="/crystal-ball-pass">ENTER CRYSTAL BALL PASS ↗</a></div>
      <nav><a href="/reviews">ALL REVIEWS →</a><a href="/play">POINTCAST PLAY →</a><a href="/b/0550">BLOCK 0550 →</a></nav>
      <p>GAME BY MICHAEL HOYDICH × CODEX / OPENAI · REVIEW BY CODEX FOR POINTCAST · AUGUST 1, 2026</p>
    </footer>
  </article>

  <style>
    :global(body) { margin: 0; background: #efe9d7; color: #101612; }
    .cbr { --ink:#101612; --paper:#efe9d7; --lime:#d9ff76; --violet:#7d4cd3; font-family:'Inter Variable',Inter,sans-serif; }
    .cbr__bar { min-height:52px; padding:0 4vw; display:flex; align-items:center; gap:26px; background:var(--ink); color:white; font:800 10px/1 'JetBrains Mono',monospace; letter-spacing:.1em; }
    .cbr__bar a { color:inherit; text-decoration:none; }
    .cbr__bar a:first-child { margin-right:auto; color:var(--lime); font-size:14px; }
    .cbr__hero { position:relative; display:grid; grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1.45fr) minmax(320px,.75fr); border-bottom:4px solid var(--ink); }
    .cbr__cover { position:relative; grid-column:1/-1; border-bottom:4px solid var(--ink); background:#08130e; overflow:hidden; }
    .cbr__cover img { display:block; width:100%; height:min(72vh,820px); object-fit:cover; }
    .cbr__stamp { position:absolute; right:3vw; top:3vw; display:grid; place-items:center; width:110px; aspect-ratio:1; border:3px solid var(--ink); border-radius:50%; background:var(--lime); color:var(--ink); font:900 11px/1.05 'JetBrains Mono',monospace; text-align:center; transform:rotate(8deg); }
    .cbr__headline { padding:clamp(34px,6vw,86px) 4vw; border-right:3px solid var(--ink); background:var(--paper); }
    .cbr__eyebrow { margin:0 0 14px; font:800 9px/1.2 'JetBrains Mono',monospace; letter-spacing:.14em; }
    .cbr__headline h1 { margin:0; font:800 clamp(56px,9vw,132px)/.72 Syne,sans-serif; letter-spacing:-.07em; }
    .cbr__headline h1 em { color:var(--violet); font:italic 500 1em/.72 Lora,serif; }
    .cbr__headline > p:not(.cbr__eyebrow) { max-width:760px; margin:32px 0 0; font:600 clamp(18px,2vw,27px)/1.3 Lora,serif; }
    .cbr__buttons { display:flex; flex-wrap:wrap; gap:10px; margin-top:30px; }
    .cbr__button { padding:14px 17px; border:2px solid var(--ink); color:var(--ink); font:800 9px/1 'JetBrains Mono',monospace; letter-spacing:.09em; text-decoration:none; }
    .cbr__button--lime { background:var(--lime); }
    .cbr__score { display:grid; place-content:center; text-align:center; background:var(--violet); color:white; }
    .cbr__score strong { font:800 clamp(90px,15vw,220px)/.7 Syne,sans-serif; letter-spacing:-.08em; }
    .cbr__score span { margin-top:20px; font:800 10px/1 'JetBrains Mono',monospace; letter-spacing:.16em; }
    .cbr main { max-width:1280px; margin:0 auto; padding:72px 4vw 120px; }
    .cbr__lede { display:grid; grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr; gap:5vw; }
    .cbr__lede p { margin:0; font:600 clamp(18px,2vw,27px)/1.5 Lora,serif; }
    .cbr__drop span { float:left; margin:-10px 10px 0 0; color:var(--violet); font:700 100px/.75 Lora,serif; }
    .cbr__facts { display:grid; grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr); margin:76px 0; border:3px solid var(--ink); }
    .cbr__facts div { min-width:0; padding:24px; border-right:2px solid var(--ink); text-align:center; }
    .cbr__facts div:last-child { border-right:0; background:var(--lime); }
    .cbr__facts strong { display:block; font:800 clamp(44px,6vw,86px)/.85 Syne,sans-serif; }
    .cbr__facts span { font:800 8px/1 'JetBrains Mono',monospace; letter-spacing:.12em; }
    .cbr__chapter { display:grid; grid-template-columns:150px minmax(0,800px); gap:40px; margin:100px 0; }
    .cbr__chapter-no { color:var(--violet); font:italic 500 110px/.8 Lora,serif; }
    .cbr__chapter h2,.cbr__split h2,.cbr__verdict h2 { margin:0 0 24px; font:800 clamp(42px,6vw,82px)/.88 Syne,sans-serif; letter-spacing:-.055em; }
    .cbr__chapter div > p:not(.cbr__eyebrow),.cbr__split p { font:550 19px/1.6 Lora,serif; }
    .cbr__quote { margin:90px calc(50% - 50vw); padding:90px 6vw; background:#10251c; color:#d9ff76; text-align:center; }
    .cbr__quote p { margin:0; font:800 clamp(32px,5.6vw,78px)/1.04 'JetBrains Mono',monospace; letter-spacing:-.04em; }
    .cbr__quote span { display:block; margin-top:30px; color:white; font:700 9px/1 'JetBrains Mono',monospace; letter-spacing:.14em; }
    .cbr__split { display:grid; grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1fr) 340px; gap:60px; align-items:start; margin:100px 0; }
    .cbr__split aside { padding:28px; border:3px solid var(--ink); background:var(--lime); }
    .cbr__split aside > span { font:800 9px/1 'JetBrains Mono',monospace; letter-spacing:.14em; }
    .cbr__split dl { margin:24px 0 0; }
    .cbr__split dl div { display:grid; grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr; gap:10px; padding:13px 0; border-top:2px solid var(--ink); }
    .cbr__split dt { font:800 16px/1 Syne,sans-serif; }
    .cbr__split dd { margin:0; font:600 12px/1.2 Lora,serif; }
    .cbr__chapter--dark { max-width:none; margin-inline:calc(50% - 50vw); padding:90px max(4vw,calc((100vw - 1280px)/2 + 4vw)); grid-template-columns:150px minmax(0,800px); background:#151519; color:#f4efdf; }
    .cbr__verdict { margin-top:100px; padding-top:50px; border-top:8px solid var(--ink); }
    .cbr__verdict-title { position:relative; }
    .cbr__round-score { position:absolute; right:0; top:-20px; display:grid; place-items:center; width:120px; aspect-ratio:1; border:3px solid var(--ink); border-radius:50%; background:var(--lime); font:800 45px/1 Syne,sans-serif; transform:rotate(5deg); }
    .cbr__round-score small { font-size:13px; }
    .cbr__ratings { display:grid; gap:14px; margin:40px 0; }
    .cbr__ratings div { display:grid; grid-template-columns:130px 1fr 40px; align-items:center; gap:14px; font:800 9px/1 'JetBrains Mono',monospace; }
    .cbr__ratings i { height:10px; background:linear-gradient(90deg,var(--violet) var(--score),#d0cab8 var(--score)); }
    .cbr__ratings b { font-size:15px; }
    .cbr__verdict-copy { display:grid; grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr; gap:24px; }
    .cbr__verdict-copy p { margin:0; padding:24px; border:2px solid var(--ink); font:600 16px/1.5 Lora,serif; }
    .cbr__bottom { grid-column:1/-1; background:var(--lime); font-size:22px!important; }
    .cbr__footer { padding:60px 4vw 40px; background:var(--ink); color:white; }
    .cbr__footer > div { display:flex; justify-content:space-between; align-items:end; }
    .cbr__footer > div a { color:var(--lime); font:800 clamp(34px,6vw,84px)/.9 Syne,sans-serif; letter-spacing:-.05em; text-decoration:none; }
    .cbr__footer nav { display:flex; flex-wrap:wrap; gap:22px; margin-top:48px; }
    .cbr__footer nav a,.cbr__footer > p { color:inherit; font:700 8px/1.4 'JetBrains Mono',monospace; letter-spacing:.1em; }
    .cbr__footer > p { margin-top:34px; opacity:.62; }
    @media(max-width:780px){
      .cbr__hero,.cbr__lede,.cbr__split,.cbr__verdict-copy { grid-template-columns:1fr; }
      .cbr__headline { border-right:0; }
      .cbr__score { padding:55px 20px; }
      .cbr__facts { grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr; }
      .cbr__facts div:nth-child(2) { border-right:0; }
      .cbr__facts div { border-bottom:2px solid var(--ink); }
      .cbr__chapter,.cbr__chapter--dark { grid-template-columns:70px 1fr; gap:18px; }
      .cbr__chapter-no { font-size:62px; }
      .cbr__bottom { grid-column:auto; }
      .cbr__round-score { position:static; margin:20px 0; }
      .cbr__footer > div { display:block; }
      .cbr__footer > div a { display:block; margin-top:14px; }
    }
    @media(max-width:520px){
      .cbr__bar { padding-inline:18px; gap:14px; font-size:7px; }
      .cbr__cover img { height:55vh; }
      .cbr__stamp { width:78px; font-size:8px; }
      .cbr__headline { padding:40px 18px; }
      .cbr main { padding:48px 18px 80px; }
      .cbr__facts div { padding:18px 8px; }
      .cbr__chapter,.cbr__chapter--dark { grid-template-columns:1fr; }
      .cbr__chapter-no { font-size:48px; }
      .cbr__ratings div { grid-template-columns:92px 1fr 35px; }
    }
  </style>
</BaseLayout>
